# Stereo: MIX's PARTS page (a part picked with its black key, knob 2 its pan), and a drum track's pan
# on MIX's 909 MIX page.
wait 300
tap LFO
wait 100
shot s01_pans.png
tapkey b0
turn K2 -40
tapkey b2
turn K2 30
wait 1200
shot s02_panned.png
expect sound5.0.3 24
expect sound5.2.3 94
# a drum voice's PAN: the 909's kick, knob 2 of MIX's 909 MIX page (the black keys pick the track)
tap LFO
expect part 0
turn SELECT -9
turn SELECT 1
tapkey b0
turn K2 -24
wait 1200
shot s03_bd_pan.png
expect sound0.0.10 40
# on MIX, ALGORITHM picks the matching page: the 808's tracks, then the levels for a 303
turn ALGO 1
expect part 1
turn ALGO 1
expect part 2
